00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.360
Former Fed Governor forecast showing lower optimism on post-crisis growth could shift how Canadian investors position rate sensitive holdings in RRSP's and TFSA's before the next policy window. This is Modern Investing Techniques, episode 148. Quick reminder, everything we discuss here is for education and entertainment. The practice investment of the day uses simulated trades with no real money. I'm not a licensed financial advisor,

